# Cross toolchain for running Loimi programs built for AArch64 Linux on an
# x86-64 host. Built from source / extracted by install.sh into
# bench/cross/{src,install,sysroot-aarch64}/ (gitignored). Nothing here is
# committed except this manifest and the script.
#
# qemu user-mode emulator (only qemu-aarch64) and ninja (qemu's build
# needs it; pip and setuptools are only put on PYTHONPATH for qemu's
# configure when the host Python lacks ensurepip). The sysroot is Debian 13 (trixie) arm64 packages, extracted
# without root (dpkg-deb -x), fetched from snapshot.debian.org so the URLs
# stay valid. The linker is the host's ld.lld-19.
